<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukrainian naval drones have struck two Russian vessels at Libya's Benghazi port and off its coast, sinking one warship and damaging another, which Ukraine described as self-defence. Libyan forces say two of their naval officers were killed in the Ukrainian attack on the Russian warship. The attacks have provoked threats of retaliation from Libyan militias and vows of reprisal from the Libyan army. Italy has summoned the Ukrainian military envoy over the strikes and is considering additional security for its troops in Libya. The conflict records two battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/world/middleeast/libya-ukraine-russia-haftar.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQWElvREQtZ3d6WUVoM0ZYcHA1bDlnS1k5cm9iOGh0Zm5ILWtyZ192WUxldkJpMUFVQTcycWVlcDlhLWJnNXExOEVhaE9VWW9NOEZLSlpnMHFod3NpaGRKZXl5bHNBMXZ1eGlKYzhvLUgtVDFYazA1UnFCM3E5aE4tRFFaWXFLeGVYcUJhbW02dDJmQzYzWDdMZGVXaGZFSHpoalhsaFBEU0YyMC1sQ3p3VWQ3Zkg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQNzdzV3FuQzVtNVRXV0hzNUxhWjdDUTAtUDBfYjlrTTNSRFhleEE1YnJmZTI0UF85Q2l0RjlaTEN6dHhxSThCV042YkRRT2ZacUJoTG02R2RWYm81c2J2NUZ4RUdXMXFOSWpzUDV6TVE0aWNBdXJZSU94NjgzVjFhY3I5MEN5d2RxcHVqRWVlUF8zUC1rT0JJMUswYVdsVlBJekd3NjNiNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNRWJHLWRjRi1LaUJReW5GX3hjSGE1c1dxZnQ0d0NiUVF2blhDZjNDcHJ1ZnU2LTYwTDl4ZDFfNk1Bd21BYTFGYWNTVXpQZllyd0lPdzJoNnBIS2hEMm9OWEZuak9q